  "intranetText": "<p><strong>ORDEM DO DIA</strong></p>\n<p><strong>10H00</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Debate na especialidade do Or&ccedil;amento do Estado para 2027</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><a href=\"http://www.parlamento.pt/ActividadeParlamentar/Paginas/DetalheIniciativa.aspx?BID=377352\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Proposta de Lei n.&ordm; 110/XVII/2.&ordf; (GOV)</a></strong></p>\n<p>Or&ccedil;amento do Estado para 2027</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table class=\"grelha\" style=\"width: 60%; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"4\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 99.696%;\" colspan=\"2\"><strong>Debate na Especialidade</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 53.4954%;\">GOV</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 46.2006%;\">120 m</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 53.4954%;\">PSD</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 46.2006%;\">96 m</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 53.4954%;\">CH</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 46.2006%;\">80 m</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 53.4954%;\">PS</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 46.2006%;\">77 m</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 53.4954%;\">IL</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 46.2006%;\">42 m</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 53.4954%;\">L</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 46.2006%;\">34 m</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 53.4954%;\">PCP</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 46.2006%;\">27 m</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 53.4954%;\">CDS-PP</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 46.2006%;\">23 m</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 53.4954%;\">BE</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 46.2006%;\">11 m</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align